sequenceDiagram
  %% Source for 19-first-deployment-flow.html. Edit this file, then run ./scripts/render-diagrams.py.
  %% Directives: docs in diagrams/README.md (Updating diagrams).
  %% @subtitle The getting-started steps, including the on-prem versus local-development TLS choice
  %% @type cloud: DC
  %% @type security: TLS
  actor OP as Operator
  participant REPO as Repository checkout
  participant TLS as TLS certificates
  participant HOST as Host resolution
  participant DC as Docker Compose

  OP->>REPO: clone the repository
  OP->>REPO: create .env and set STACK_DOMAIN
  alt on-prem certificate delivered
    OP->>TLS: point Traefik at the delivered cert and key
  else local development only
    OP->>TLS: mkcert local-development fallback
  end
  OP->>HOST: resolve the hostnames
  opt enabling the grafana profile
    OP->>REPO: fetch pinned Grafana dashboards
  end
  OP->>REPO: write the Prometheus metrics key file
  OP->>DC: docker compose config --quiet
  DC-->>OP: configuration valid
  OP->>DC: start the prod and/or dev profile
  DC-->>OP: verify health and routes
